toshiba-estudio2323am (0.0.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging skeleton.
  * Encoder core (tsb_enc) with PackBits reference implementation and
    raw/capture dump modes for protocol comparison against wire captures.
  * CUPS filter shell (rastertotoshiba) accepting application/vnd.cups-raster
    at 1bpp or 8bpp, buffering one page for multi-copy support.
  * NOTE: the private device payload is not yet confirmed. The filter cannot
    produce a printable stream until docs/protocol-re.md is completed.

